    "Color-coded fills and smooth gradients are unavailable in Segmented mode. Switch to Hierarchical or Gradient to adjust these options." : {
      "comment" : "An explanatory text that appears when the user tries to enable color-coded color gradients in Segmented progress bars. It instructs the user to switch to Hierarchical or Gradient progress bars to enable these features.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "'세그먼트' 모드에서는 색상별 채우기 및 부드러운 그라데이션을 사용할 수 없습니다. 이 옵션을 조정하려면 '계층형' 또는 '그라데이션'으로 전환하세요."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Kleurgecodeerde vullingen en vloeiende verlopen zijn niet beschikbaar in de gesegmenteerde modus. Schakel naar Hiërarchisch of Verloop om deze opties aan te passen."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Enchimentos codificados por cores e gradientes suaves não estão disponíveis no modo Segmentado. Mude para Hierárquico ou Gradiente para ajustar essas opções."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Цветная заливка и градиенты недоступны в режиме Segmented."
          }
        },
        "th" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "การเติมสีตามรหัสและไล่เฉดสีแบบนุ่มไม่พร้อมใช้ในโหมด Segmented เปลี่ยนเป็น Hierarchical หรือ Gradient เพื่อปรับตัวเลือก"
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Renk kodlu dolgular ve pürüzsüz gradyanlar Bölümlenmiş modda kullanılamaz. Bu seçenekleri ayarlamak için Hiyerarşik veya Gradyan'a geçin."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "分段模式下不支持彩色填充和平滑渐变。切换到层级或渐变模式来调整这些选项。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Color-coded fills are unavailable in Segmented mode. Switch to Hierarchical or Gradient in Settings › Volume & Brightness to adjust advanced options." : {

    },
    "Color-coded fills are unavailable in Segmented mode. Switch to Hierarchical or Gradient inside Controls › Noori to adjust advanced options." : {
      "comment" : "A message explaining that color-coded battery indicators are unavailable in segmented progress bar style. It also includes a suggestion to switch to a more advanced progress bar style to adjust advanced options.",
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "'세그먼트' 모드에서는 색상별 채우기를 사용할 수 없습니다. 고급 옵션을 조정하려면 '제어기 › Noori'에서 '계층형' 또는 '그라데이션'으로 전환하세요."
