          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Noori"
          }
        }
      },
      "shouldTranslate" : false
    },
    "Noori always listens to selected-provider brightness events, and listens to provider volume events only when external volume listener is enabled." : {
      "comment" : "A footer text that explains the behavior of the third-party DDC integration settings. | A footer text that explains the behavior of the third-party DDC integration settings. | merge:ko:alt='Noori은 항상 선택한 제공자의 밝기 이벤트를 수신하며, 외부 음량 감지가 활성화된 경우에만 제공자의 음량 이벤트를 수신합니다.'",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Noori은 항상 선택된 제공업체의 밝기 이벤트를 감지하며, 외부 음량 감지 기능이 활성화된 경우에만 제공업체의 음량 이벤트를 감지합니다."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Noori luistert altijd naar helderheidsgebeurtenissen van de geselecteerde provider en luistert alleen naar volumegebeurtenissen van de provider als de externe volumelistener is ingeschakeld."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Noori отслеживает яркость от выбранного провайдера, а громкость — только при внешнем контроле."
          }
        },
        "th" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Noori รับฟังเหตุการณ์ความสว่างจากผู้ให้บริการที่เลือกเสมอ และรับฟังเหตุการณ์ระดับเสียงเมื่อเปิดใช้ตัวรับฟังระดับเสียงภายนอก"
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Noori, seçili sağlayıcının parlaklık olaylarını her zaman dinler; sağlayıcı ses düzeyi olaylarını ise yalnızca harici ses düzeyi dinleyicisi etkinken dinler."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Noori 始终监听所选提供商的亮度事件，仅在启用外部音量监听器时监听提供商的音量事件。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Noori keeps native volume key interception. External provider volume payloads are ignored while this is off." : {
      "comment" : "A description of the behavior of Noori's volume key interception when the external volume control listener is disabled.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Noori은 시스템 기본 음량 키 제어 기능을 유지합니다. 이 기능을 끄면 외부 제공업체의 음량 데이터가 무시됩니다."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Noori behoudt de onderschepping van de oorspronkelijke volumesleutel. Volumepayloads van externe providers worden genegeerd als dit is uitgeschakeld."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Внешние данные громкости игнорируются, пока включен системный перехват."
          }
        },
        "th" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Noori ยังคงดักจับปุ่มระดับเสียงเดิม ข้อมูลระดับเสียงจากผู้ให้บริการภายนอกจะถูกละเลยเมื่อปิด"
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Noori yerel ses tuşu yakalamayı korur. Bu kapalıyken harici sağlayıcı ses düzeyi verileri yok sayılır."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Noori 保持原生音量键拦截。关闭此项时将忽略外部提供商的音量数据。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Noori's built-in volume key interception is disabled while external volume listening is on. Volume HUD/OSD will follow %@ payloads." : {
      "comment" : "A description below the toggle that explains the effect of enabling or disabling the feature.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "외부 음량 감지 기능이 켜져 있으면 Noori의 내장 음량 키 제어 기능이 비활성화됩니다. 음량 HUD/OSD는 %@ 데이터를 기준으로 표시됩니다."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "De ingebouwde onderschepping van de volumetoetsen van Noori is uitgeschakeld terwijl luisteren naar extern volume is ingeschakeld. Volume-HUD/OSD volgt %@ payloads."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Встроенный перехват отключен. HUD/OSD следует данным от %@."
          }
        },
        "th" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Noori's built-in volume key interception is disabled while external volume listening is on. Volume HUD/OSD will follow %@ payloads."
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Harici ses dinleme açıkken Noori'un yerleşik ses tuşu yakalaması devre dışı bırakılır. Ses HUD/OSD gösterimi %@ verilerini izler."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "启用外部音量监听时，Noori 的内置音量键拦截已禁用。音量 HUD/OSD 将跟随 %@ 的数据。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
