    "The languages for this song aren't downloaded yet." : {

    },
    "These indicators appear in the notch when apps are using your camera or microphone, matching macOS's native privacy indicators." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "앱이 카메라 또는 마이크를 사용 중일 때 노치에 표시기가 나타나며, 이는 macOS의 기본 개인정보 보호 표시기와 동일하게 작동합니다."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Deze indicatoren verschijnen in de inkeping wanneer apps je camera of microfoon gebruiken, wat overeenkomt met de eigen privacy-indicatoren van macOS."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Esses indicadores aparecem no notch quando os aplicativos estão usando sua câmera ou microfone, correspondendo aos indicadores de privacidade nativos do macOS."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Эти индикаторы появляются в вырезе, когда приложения используют камеру или микрофон."
          }
        },
        "th" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "ตัวบ่งชี้เหล่านี้ปรากฏในรอยบากเมื่อแอปใช้กล้องหรือไมโครโฟนของคุณ ตรงกับตัวบ่งชี้ความเป็นส่วนตัวเดิมของ macOS"
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Bu göstergeler, uygulamalar kameranızı veya mikrofonunuzu kullanırken çentikte görünür ve macOS'un yerel gizlilik göstergeleriyle eşleşir."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "当应用使用您的相机或麦克风时，这些指示器会出现在刘海中，与 macOS 原生隐私指示器一致。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "These temporary HUDs recreate the charging, low-battery, and full-battery notch alerts." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Deze tijdelijke HUD's reproduceren de waarschuwingen voor opladen, batterij bijna leeg en batterij vol."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Эти временные HUD воссоздают уведомления зарядки, низкого и полного заряда для предпросмотра."
          }
        },
        "th" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "HUD ชั่วคราวเหล่านี้สร้างการแจ้งเตือนรอยบากการชาร์จ แบตเตอรี่ต่ำ และแบตเตอรี่เต็มใหม่"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这些临时提示框再现了充电、低电量和充满电时的刘海提醒。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
